WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.760
WHEN THE WALLS FALL DOWN

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:23.480
It's Eva! Something's happened to her!

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.120
Mama!

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.920
Mama... Flopin...

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:35.280
&lt;i&gt;Yugo the Eliatrope, protect your friends.&lt;/i&gt;

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.680
&lt;i&gt;And if you survive,&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;watch out for the Enutrof.&lt;/i&gt;

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.200
Dathura, hold on!

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.720
That can't be anything good.

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:54.160
Please untie me, darling.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.800
I will consider untying you...

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.440
if you give me a passionate kiss.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:12.280
Eva...

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.160
Any idea what's going on, Oropo?

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:50.960
A powerful spirit,
perhaps a spirit more powerful than me...

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:53.200
It could destroy everything.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:11.520
Mama!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.880
-It's the baby.
-Is it okay?

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:17.720
Yes, don't worry. I feel it moving.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:21.520
But you were hit by a spell.
Don't you think you need to...?

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:25.720
It's close now.

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:35.680
Flopin!
Untie me so I can help your mother.

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:38.200
Give me one good reason to trust you.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:41.680
All you need to know right now
is that I'm an Eniripsa,

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:45.080
and if I help her,
there's a chance everything will go well.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:03.960
Flopin!

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:14.840
If you don't keep your promise,
I will make you pay.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:19.000
Flopin, your kind spirit is what will
make you an excellent Cra god.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.480
Threats don't suit you.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.760
So, let's do this.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:26.680
I thought this place
was under your control.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.840
It is, but it doesn't seem
to suit everyone.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:31.640
Any idea what's happening?

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:35.320
An ultra-powerful being is destroying
our dimension.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:41.920
There are more surprises in store for us.
I need your help.

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:43.600
Tell me what to do.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:47.240
I'm going to try to contain
the destruction of the tower.

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:49.280
Our entire mission depends on it.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:54.760
I'll find out who's responsible
and stop them... by any means necessary.

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:57.400
It's coming from Sram level.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:06:59.320
I'll take care of it.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:07.000
Keep breathing.
I'll try and stop the pain for you.

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:11.440
Thank you.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:42.720
Well, this is a surprise.
Is Evangelyne causing all of this?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.920
Actually, it's her baby.

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:50.840
Adamai, just leave us alone.
It's complicated enough.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:54.320
Help Oropo instead.
I imagine he has a lot on his plate.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:56.680
You guys are quite the family.

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:01.600
Stay away from my mother,
or you'll regret it.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.760
We'll have to have
this conversation later.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:14.160
Now, let's call a short truce
until things are resolved.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:20.520
I'm not in... any position
to suggest anything else.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.280
Good luck, then, Evangelyne!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.520
Thank you, Adamai.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.480
Stay with us, Evangelyne.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:42.840
Flopin, keep your mother awake,
she has to keep pushing.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.320
-But...
-Do you hear me, Flopin?

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:52.480
She mustn't pass out,
otherwise we'll lose them both.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:26.720
Dathura seems to have
a grudge against you.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.560
Yeah, who knows what that's about?

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:35.960
All of this has something to do
with my mom.

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:38.920
I can't explain it, but I'm sure of it.

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:02.680
Well?

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.240
It's Evangelyne.

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:08.720
-What does she have to do with it?
-She's giving birth.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:12.080
It seems the baby is responsible
for everything.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:17.120
Of course, the child of a former god
wouldn't be anything less than a demigod.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:21.720
In the meantime, we need to find
a way to calm its spirit,

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.840
or it will destroy everything.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:25.400
I'm going to need you, Ad.

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.240
What do you want me to do?

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:31.920
Help me, lend me
some of the Eliatrope Dofus powers,

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.400
so I can support the baby's spirit.

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:14.360
Gently, Ad, I can't endure as much as you.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:22.800
Very good,
I will try to reconstruct the tower.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.920
Flopin, you can't let your mother faint.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:02.760
No, but I... All right, fine, then.

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:07.440
Did you seriously just slap me?

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:10.320
For your own good, Mama,
you have to stay awake.

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:13.360
Stay as strong as you can.
We're counting on you.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.480
Give me your hand.

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:24.480
Your father's not even here for this.
He's got another thing coming!

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:28.400
I'm going to count to three,
then push with everything you've got.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.120
All right.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.400
One... Two... Three! Push hard now!

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:38.560
I see the head. Push again!

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.280
Come on, Mama, you can do it!

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.200
A test of willpower against a newborn.

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:18.200
If it didn't hurt so much, it'd be funny.

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:19.680
Hold on, Oropo!

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.440
You know
it could be a lot worse than this.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:55.440
You're in less danger
without the Dofus in your body.

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:22.240
Thank you. Thank you, Dathura.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:26.040
We'd have all been goners without you.
Any idea what's going on?

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:28.720
This world was created by Oropo.

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:33.480
He made it using the Eliacube
and the strength of his spirit.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.120
In a way, we're all his guests.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.280
No one can find us here.

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:40.600
But why is everything falling apart?

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:46.120
Because a powerful and tormented spirit
is threatening this dimension's existence.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:49.800
As for him, I tried to warn you.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:53.520
-He's not your friend.
-Yeah, I've known that for a while.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:56.000
Ruel cares a lot about money, but...

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.280
Hang on, Evangelyne, almost there.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:50.840
A new demigod has entered the family.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.280
He's so cute!

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:07.680
It's going to be two against three
at home now, my love.

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:10.720
You're off to a good start.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:14.360
If you're anything like them,
a good meal will calm you down.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:21.960
Thank you for everything you've done,
Echo.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.800
Without you,
I don't know what would have happened.

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:29.800
We're even. I don't know what Toxine
would have done without your help.

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:42.280
It's over. That was a really close call.

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.760
The Sadlygroves, what a family.

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.320
Yes, indeed.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.160
I'll have to rebuild something
a little more practical.

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:06.480
Lend me some more of your strength,
brother.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:21.400
My underwear, my underwear!

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.760
Anything but my underwear!

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:33.920
That was a very passionate kiss.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.400
So, you'll untie me now, right?

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:38.920
No!

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:49.480
It's falling, without falling.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.880
Perper, you've always been such a poet.

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:14.000
Do you hear that?

00:18:14.080 --> 00:18:16.760
Sort of. Is someone beating a pig?

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:20.920
-Dally, don't you get it?
-Get what?

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:24.560
Wasn't someone ready to pop
like a barrel of bamboo milk

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.000
last time you saw her?

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:33.920
-Oh! It's my baby!
-Typical.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.880
You could have said something earlier,
idiot!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:44.920
Hey, Gou, do you have enough strength
to throw me high enough to see?

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.080
It's worth a try.

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:00.400
Look, Mama!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:06.320
Throw me that way, halfway.

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:11.400
There's a new addition to the family!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.320
Look over there!

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:17.680
It's my dad!

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:22.360
Hold on, Elely.
They're all the same in that family.

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:25.440
We've got nothing better to do,
so let's follow her.

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:29.760
Dathura, I'd like to see you again.

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:31.800
You know where to find me, Amalia.

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:39.600
Dathura, Oropo is going to be very angry.

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.280
You're not being helpful.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:45.560
You're too stupid to see
what he's capable of. He'll do anything.

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:09.960
You are extremely ungrateful
for everything he did for us.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:12.680
He saved all of our lives.

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:17.240
Before he asked us to join him,
we were nothing.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:21.520
Now he's in the process of transforming us
into the new gods.

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:23.720
Why do you think we'll be better off?

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:26.840
All I need to know is
he believes in this mission.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:31.720
It's called having a bit of faith
in others.

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.240
Eva!

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:11.200
Careful, you Iopbrain.

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:18.920
Aw, a baby Iop.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:21.760
His first punch!

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.480
No, he punched me first!

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:28.000
Dally, without Flopin helping me,
it could have turned out pretty bad.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.800
Come here, you little mama's boy.

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:38.800
Mama! Papa!

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:40.480
Be careful, Iopbrain!

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:02.640
That couldn't have been Ruel, no way.

00:22:09.920 --> 00:22:11.520
I'm almost finished now.

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:12.920
Just a little more.

00:22:24.640 --> 00:22:26.120
At last.

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:29.200
-You, but...
-You're here!

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:31.000
You're close enough to touch.

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:35.080
How I've dreamed of you.

00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:07.240
Yugo?

